<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

<title>Our Wednesday ❤️</title>

<style>
body{
    margin:0;
    background:#05070d;
    color:white;
    font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"SF Pro Display",sans-serif;
    text-align:center;
}

.container{
    max-width:900px;
    margin:auto;
    padding:40px 20px;
}

h1{
    font-size:55px;
}

.card{
    background:rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
    backdrop-filter:blur(20px);
    border-radius:30px;
    padding:30px;
    margin:25px 0;
    border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.2);
}

.card h2{
    font-size:35px;
}

.card p{
    font-size:18px;
    opacity:.8;
}

button{
    padding:18px 45px;
    border:none;
    border-radius:50px;
    font-size:20px;
    cursor:pointer;
    margin:20px;
}

.yes{
    background:white;
    color:black;
}

.no{
    background:#222;
    color:white;
    position:relative;
}

#finish{
    display:none;
    position:fixed;
    inset:0;
    background:#05070d;
    justify-content:center;
    align-items:center;
    flex-direction:column;
}

</style>
</head>


<body>


<div class="container">

<h1>Our Wednesday ❤️</h1>

<p>
A special date invitation
</p>


<div class="card">
<h2>❄️ Ice City</h2>
<p>
First stop. Walking, laughing and making memories together.
</p>
</div>


<div class="card">
<h2>🍜 Seoul Mun</h2>
<p>
Dinner time:
<br>
🍗 Korean Chicken
<br>
🍜 Ramyeon
<br>
🍙 Kimbap
<br>
🍧 Dessert
</p>
</div>


<div class="card">
<h2>🌉 Anhor Riverside</h2>
<p>
Evening walk under city lights.
</p>
</div>


<div class="card">
<h2>💌 My message</h2>
<p>
Maybe this Wednesday becomes one of our favorite memories.
I want to spend it with you ❤️
</p>
</div>



<h2>
Will you be my date? 🤍
</h2>


<button class="yes" onclick="yesClick()">
YES ❤️
</button>


<button class="no" id="no">
NO
</button>


</div>



<div id="finish">

<h1>❤️ Thank You</h1>

<p>
See you on Wednesday 🌹
</p>

</div>



<script>

let no=document.getElementById("no");


no.onmouseover=function(){

let x=Math.random()*400-200;
let y=Math.random()*300-150;

no.style.transform=
`translate(${x}px,${y}px)`;

}



function yesClick(){

document.getElementById("finish").style.display="flex";

}

</script>


</body>
</html>
